                "type": "result",
                "title": "Exact replay of the published order-23 lower endpoint",
                "summary": "The matrix in `matrix.txt` is a complete \\(23\\times 23\\) matrix with entries\nin \\(\\{-1,+1\\}\\), encoded as `-` and `+`. Exact fraction-free elimination\ngives\n\n\\[\n  |\\det A|=2^{22}\\,3\\,5^6\\,67\\,211\n  =2{,}779{,}447{,}296{,}000{,}000.\n\\]\n\nThis independently replays the published lower endpoint already stated in the\nproblem. It does **not** claim a new record, a stronger lower bound, or\noptimality of this matrix.\n\nScope qualifications:\n- This certifies only the already stated lower endpoint D_23 ≥ 2,779,447,296,000,000.\n- It does not establish a new record, a larger lower bound, a stronger upper bound, or optimality.\n- No external provenance claim is required for the determinant certificate.",
